Flag  1: Output Overload
Flag  2: Output Short Circuit
Flag  3: Output Over Voltage
Flag  4: <Not Used>
Flag  5: Overtemperature
Flag  6: Backfeed Relay Fault
Flag  7: <Not Used>
Flag  8: PFC Input Relay Fault
Flag  9: <Not Used>
Flag 10: Bypass Relay Fault
