        "dcmim2ConfigSysHighTempTrip" : {
            "nodetype" : "scalar",
            "moduleName" : "PowerNet-MIB",
            "oid" : "1.3.6.1.4.1.318.1.1.9.3.1.1",
            "status" : "current",
            "syntax" : {
                "type" : { "module" :"", "name" : "Integer32"},
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """Trip level (threshold) at which System High Temp alarm condition is created.
Range 28 to 100 (degC).

Values are represented in thousandths of a degree.
Units are displayed in the scale shown in
the 'dcmim2StatusSysTempUnits' OID (Celsius or Fahrenheit).""",
        }, # scalar
        "dcmim2ConfigSysHighTempReset" : {
            "nodetype" : "scalar",
            "moduleName" : "PowerNet-MIB",
            "oid" : "1.3.6.1.4.1.318.1.1.9.3.1.2",
            "status" : "current",
            "syntax" : {
                "type" : { "module" :"", "name" : "Integer32"},
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """Level at which System High Temp alarm condition is reset (cleared).
Range 25 to (upper temp - 3) (degC).

Values are represented in thousandths of a degree.
Units are displayed in the scale shown in
the 'dcmim2StatusSysTempUnits' OID (Celsius or Fahrenheit).""",
        }, # scalar
        "dcmim2ConfigSysLowTempTrip" : {
            "nodetype" : "scalar",
            "moduleName" : "PowerNet-MIB",
            "oid" : "1.3.6.1.4.1.318.1.1.9.3.1.3",
            "status" : "current",
            "syntax" : {
                "type" : { "module" :"", "name" : "Integer32"},
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """Trip level (threshold) at which System Low Temp alarm condition is created.
Range -100 to 10 (degC).
Values are represented in thousandths of a degree.
Units are displayed in the scale shown in
the 'dcmim2StatusSysTempUnits' OID (Celsius or Fahrenheit).""",
        }, # scalar
        "dcmim2ConfigSysLowTempReset" : {
            "nodetype" : "scalar",
            "moduleName" : "PowerNet-MIB",
            "oid" : "1.3.6.1.4.1.318.1.1.9.3.1.4",
            "status" : "current",
            "syntax" : {
                "type" : { "module" :"", "name" : "Integer32"},
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """Level at which System Low Temp alarm condition is reset (cleared).
Range (lower temp + 3) to 13 (degC).
Values are represented in thousandths of a degree.
Units are displayed in the scale shown in
the 'dcmim2StatusSysTempUnits' OID (Celsius or Fahrenheit).""",
        }, # scalar
