A value of notApplicable indicates that this OID does
not apply to this device due to its configuration.""",
        }, # scalar
        "airFMSysResetUserDflts" : {
            "nodetype" : "scalar",
            "moduleName" : "PowerNet-MIB",
            "oid" : "1.3.6.1.4.1.318.1.1.13.1.4.4.8",
