                    },
                    "forcedOn" : {
                        "nodetype" : "namednumber",
                        "number" : "2"
                    },
                },
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """When this OID value is (1) automatic, the system determines
which units are used as primary units and which units are used as backups.
