                    },
                    "enabled" : {
                        "nodetype" : "namednumber",
                        "number" : "2"
                    },
                },
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """The annunciator output signal reset method:
disabled(1) means the annunciator signal output will be reset when the reset button is pressed.
