            "syntax" : {
                "type" : { "module" :"", "name" : "Integer32"},
            },
            "access" : "readonly",
            "description" :
                """This is a bit map representing the active alarms for this subfeed:

b0 - Minimum current threshold exceeded (critical)
b1 - Low current threshold exceeded (warning)
