in tenths of Amps""",
        }, # column
        "rPDU2AdvBankConfigBankPeakCurrentReset" : {
            "nodetype" : "column",
            "moduleName" : "PowerNet-MIB",
            "oid" : "1.3.6.1.4.1.318.1.1.26.14.1.1.8",
            "status" : "current",
            "syntax" : {
                "type" :                 {
                    "basetype" : "Enumeration",
                    "noOperation" : {
                        "nodetype" : "namednumber",
                        "number" : "1"
                    },
                    "reset" : {
                        "nodetype" : "namednumber",
                        "number" : "2"
                    },
                },
            },
            "access" : "readwrite",
            "description" :
                """Setting this OID to reset (2) will cause the existing peak current value
to be replaced by the present load current value.

Getting this OID will do nothing and return the noOperation(1) value.""",
        }, # column
